+<b>Human readable granularity:</b> With CDA, narrative exists for each section.  With FHIR documents,
+the attested section narrative is carried in <a href="composition-definitions.html#Composition.section.text">Composition.section.text</a>,
+including nested sections, and <a href="composition-definitions.html#Composition.section.entry">Composition.section.entry</a>
+references resources that provide supporting data.  Usually this means the narrative in CDA and FHIR will
+correspond.  Applications converting between CDA and FHIR still need to map section text and supporting
+entries explicitly.
